[h2]Build 0.9.122[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Overclocking for the industrial repair center.[/b] A new Overclock button sets how hard it runs, from 10% to 200%, just like Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory's machines. Power draw and heat rise with the square of the speed, using the same formula as VFE.
[*][b]Slow and careful, or fast and rough.[/b] At 100% it works exactly as before, like a skill 10 crafter. Turn it down and it takes its time: at 10% it works like a skill 20 master, uses fewer materials and almost never botches a repair. Push it to 200% and it rushes through gear like a skill 5 novice.
[*][b]VFE Factory boosters and heatsinks work on the repair center.[/b] With Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory installed, factory boosters raise its overclock ceiling and factory heatsinks cut its heat, the same as on VFE's own machines.
[/list]
[list]
[*]Existing repair centers start at 100%, so nothing changes until you move the slider. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
